<title>HONG KONG: Mancon Bhd unit sets US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Mancon Bhd unit sets US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by joint lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.  BORROWER   MANCON (BVI) INVESTMENT HOLDING CO LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  MANCON BERHAD</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$100 MLN COUPON     L+150BP   MATURITY   5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 RE-OFFER   99.625</p>
<p> PUTS	 YR 3 &amp; 4   CALLS	NONE	LAUNCHED   20.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	 REPAYMENT  BULLET    REPLIES    22.MAY.97</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	 SALES LMTS STANDARD  DENOMS     $250K</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	  CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ  YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH    HOME CTRY  MALAYSIA  PAY DATE   --</p>
<p> FEES	 75BP FLAT</p>
<p>JOINT LEAD MANAGERS DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL AND DCB BANK BHD</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
